ifferent races under his flag  this diverse and unprecedented group  starts to grow an influence in  popularity  due to its shared wisdom friendship and  equality  at some point it grows so large and  influential  that it establishes a kingdom that grows  into a place of peace and prosperity  and the leader of this kingdom is a man  known by the name of  joyboy joyboy's ultimate goal is to  unite all the different races and bring  the endless warring and violence amongst  them to a close  and segregation and racism and create a  united world of freedom and justice  so arguably what the story of one piece  will in the end be all about  we do know that joyboy was already  starting to fulfill this plan  as he promised the fishman to bring them  up to the surface and give them  equal rights to the humans however with  the growing influence of the ancient  kingdom  and its ideals of equality and freedom  the kingdom of the humans started to  feel threatened and plan to overthrow  joy boy  20 of them banded together to declare  war on the ancient kingdom  but initially failed due to its immense  shared wisdom  power and technology however when the  war threatened to be lost  they were unexpectedly offered help by  the king of the demon clan  which was despised and feared by all the  other races  he offered the kings to share the powers  of his people with them in order to turn  the tides against the ancient kingdom  and make them the gods and new rulers of  the entire world  all of this however under one condition  that he would become the one true king  ruling from the shadows blinded by the  power of this offer  19 of the 20 kings took the deal and so  the demon king bestowed upon them  the power of the devil fruits one of  them however  the king of alabasta was wary of the  devil and his power  and secretly decided to inform joyboy  about the coming threats  upon hearing about the new fantastic  powers of their enemies and their  inevitable defeat  joyboy decided to do everything in his  power to ensure that his vision would be  made reality someday  the kozuki clan that were part of his  kingdom  created the ponoglyphs with instructions  and information about the true history  of the world  meanwhile using its advanced technology  the ancient kingdom created three  powerful weapons to oppose the power of  devil fruits  the powers of poseidon to command  powerful sea monsters inherited by the  fishmen  the power of pluton a mighty battleship  capable of destroying entire islands  as well as uranus a weapon of unknown  power  that might have enabled space travel and  finally  some secret was hidden on an island that  would later become known as  love tale just as joy boy had feared the  tides of the war  quickly changed with the sudden  appearance of the devil fruit powers  with their help the kings artificially  changed the geography of the entire  planet  to ensure their rule and position of  power for centuries to come  and so the ancient kingdom fell and the  world had to wait for the return of a  new joy boy  that would finally fulfill his dream and  unite the world

